# Pinned CSR toolchain image -- the SINGLE source of truth for which image both
# bin/csr-build (local) and .github/workflows/pages.yml (deploy) run, so their
# PDF/docx bytes match bit-for-bit. build-image.yml pushes the image and prints
# the @sha256 digest to paste here (its own commit), which re-mints the committed
# .sha512 on the next csr-build. The first non-comment, non-blank line is the ref.
#
# Bootstrap value (:latest tag) until the first GHCR push; migration replaces it
# with the digest form ghcr.io/org-ai-assisted/csr-build-toolchain@sha256:<digest>.
ghcr.io/org-ai-assisted/csr-build-toolchain:latest
